sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant H as Home
  participant F as Order Form
  participant A as Delivery Address
  participant P as Confirm pop-up
  participant S as Server
  participant D as Order Details
  C->>H: 1: Open Home
  H->>S: 2: GET /api/orders/home
  S-->>H: 3: Your current order, price list
  C->>H: 4: Tap Order Now
  H->>F: 5: Open Order Form
  Note over F: First saved address filled in
  C->>F: 6: Type, gallons, delivery date
  opt Change the address
    C->>F: 7: Tap Delivery address
    F->>A: 8: Saved addresses, Pin on map (search a place) or Type address
    A-->>F: 9: Use this address
  end
  C->>F: 10: Tap Place order
  F->>P: 11: Confirm order (total, address, date, cash on delivery)
  C->>P: 12: Confirm
  P->>S: 13: POST /api/orders
  alt Details valid
    S-->>P: 14: 201 Thank you for your order
    P->>D: 15: Open Order Details (Waiting for order to be accepted)
  else Details not valid
    S-->>F: 16: 400 red message, field marked
  end
